  "notes": [
    "The Linea transaction drained seven pools at once and precedes the attacker's first zkSync Era pool drain by five seconds; the thirteen zkSync transactions, one pool each through the same attack contract, are the campaign. No other non-vault velocore__execute caller was found on Linea after the exploit.",
    "Loss is the Linea and zkSync vaults' token outflows, VLP accounting tokens excluded. RF, VC, SIS, MVX, IBEX and ZKE are valued at the ETH and USDC.e the attacker realised selling them; LVC, whose only market was the drained pool and which was never withdrawn from the attack contract, at zero. zkSync USDT is priced at $1."
